# 🤖 Multi-Agent Robotics Fleet Coordination Platform

> An intelligent multi-agent system to coordinate **hundreds of autonomous robots** in warehouses, factories, hospitals, and airports — with real-time task allocation, path planning, collision avoidance, and battery management.

