## 🌟 Overview

The **Multi-Agent Robotics Fleet Coordination Platform** is a full-stack AI system that coordinates **100+ autonomous robots** working simultaneously in large-scale facilities.

Instead of manually controlling each robot, the platform uses a **team of 5 specialized AI agents** that collaborate in real-time to:

- 🎯 Assign tasks to the right robots
- 🗺️ Plan optimal navigation paths
- ⚠️ Prevent collisions
- 🔋 Manage battery life
- 👑 Supervise the entire fleet

Think of it as **air traffic control for robots**.

---

## ❗ Problem Statement

Managing a fleet of 100+ autonomous robots is extremely complex:

| Challenge | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Task Allocation** | Matching hundreds of tasks to hundreds of robots efficiently |
| **Navigation** | Finding shortest, safest paths in dynamic environments |
| **Collision Avoidance** | Preventing robots from crashing into each other or humans |
| **Battery Management** | Charging robots at the right time without disrupting operations |
| **Real-Time Coordination** | All decisions must happen in milliseconds |

**Manual coordination is impossible.** That's why this platform uses **multi-agent AI**.

---

## 🤖 The 5 Intelligent Agents

### 1️⃣ Task Allocation Agent
- Matches incoming tasks to the most suitable robot
- Considers: distance, battery, workload, capability
- Uses **Hungarian Algorithm** + **Priority Scheduling** + **Gemini AI reasoning**

### 2️⃣ Navigation Agent
- Plans optimal path from point A → B
- Uses **A\* (A-Star)** and **Dijkstra** algorithms
- Avoids static + dynamic obstacles
- Continuously recalculates on environment change

### 3️⃣ Collision Avoidance Agent
- Detects potential collisions in real-time
- Uses **Potential Field Method** for repulsion zones
- Assigns priority when robots compete for space
- Slows, stops, or reroutes robots dynamically

### 4️⃣ Battery Management Agent
- Monitors all robots' battery levels
- Predicts when robots will run out of power
- Sends robots to charging stations proactively
- Prevents charging station bottlenecks

### 5️⃣ Fleet Supervisor Agent
- The "manager" — orchestrates all 4 agents
- Resolves conflicts between agents
- Uses **Gemini AI** for natural-language situation reports
- Handles emergencies (failures, blocked zones, etc.)
- Maintains full audit log of decisions

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 🎨 Frontend Features
- ✅ Real-time **Live Dashboard** with KPIs
- ✅ Interactive **Warehouse Map** (SVG/Canvas)
- ✅ **Agent Reasoning Panel** — watch agents think live
- ✅ Task management (create, assign, track)
- ✅ Robot fleet view with battery, status, location
- ✅ **Battery analytics** with charts and gauges
- ✅ **Collision heatmap** visualization
- ✅ **AI Chat** powered by Gemini
- ✅ Dark futuristic UI with animations
- ✅ Simulation controls (start/stop/pause/reset)

### ⚙️ Backend Features
- ✅ 5 autonomous AI agents running in parallel
- ✅ Real-time task allocation with priorities
- ✅ A* pathfinding on dynamic grid
- ✅ Collision prediction & avoidance
- ✅ Predictive battery management
- ✅ Gemini AI integration for reasoning
- ✅ Full simulation engine (tick-based)
- ✅ WebSocket broadcasting every 500ms
- ✅ Complete audit log of all decisions
- ✅ REST API with auto-generated docs

