💡 Ye File Kya-Kya Ignore Karegi
Category	Ignored
Python	__pycache__, .pyc, venv, .egg-info
React/Node	node_modules, dist, build, .vite
Database	*.db, *.sqlite3, fleet.db
Env	.env, .env.local (secrets safe)
IDE	.vscode, .idea, *.swp
OS	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db
Logs	*.log, logs/
Testing	.pytest_cache, coverage/
⚠️ Important Note
✅ .env.example upload hoga (template ke liye)

❌ .env upload nahi hoga (secrets ke liye — Gemini key safe rahegi)

❌ fleet.db upload nahi hoga (local database)

Agar kabhi force karke kuch upload karna ho:

powershell
git add -f path/to/file
